    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Schnittger Bourne is delighted to bring this truly unique property to the lettings market.\r\n\r\nNestled in a fantastic location and within walking distance of all local amenities, 90 Heathervue is an impressive adaptation of a contemporary home, offering plenty of space in addition to added extras. Boasting a three double bedrooms, a first floor en-suite loft and a garden room complete with private sauna, massage area and bathroom, this property is one of a kind.\r\n\r\nBeautifully presented and in the heart of Greystones, No. 90 is set approached by a landscaped and paved front garden, with off-street parking for two vehicles.\r\n\r\nLocation:\r\n\r\nGreystones offers a wide variety of top-class restaurants, pubs, cafes, boutiques, pharmacies, supermarkets, and a small theatre.\r\nThe locality caters to a diverse and active lifestyle, offering a wide variety of outdoor pursuits and leisure facilities on your doorstep, from hiking to yoga to angling and diving.\r\n\r\nHeathervue is also ideally placed for an abundance of sporting activities including rugby, GAA, tennis, soccer, and sailing.\r\n\r\nThe nearby Shoreline Swimming Pool and Leisure Complex is popular for its well-equipped gym and swimming facilities, and there is a host golf clubs in the neighbourhood, such as Greystones Golf Club and the famous Druids Glen Golf Resort.\r\n\r\nThere is plenty of choice when it comes to education, as there are several primary and secondary schools within walking distance.\r\n\r\nA seaside retreat that is less than an hour outside Dublin City Centre, Greystones is well connected, with transport links including DART and bus routes, and there is also easy access to the N11 and M50."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The ground floor accommodation, which combines stylish interiors with standout features, includes an open plan kitchen / living room with integrated appliances such as fridge freezer, gas hob, oven and dishwasher, three double bedrooms with built-in wardrobe storage and LED lighting, main bathroom, and spiral staircase to a spacious loft, with lounge area, pull-out guest bed and en suite."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "The standout feature of this property is the bespoke outdoor wellness space, complete with:\r\n• Private timber-built sauna\r\n• Separate shower/changing area\r\n• Skylit spa-style setting\r\n• Low-maintenance outdoor areas ideal for relaxing or entertaining"
      },
      {
